+## WP01 UI/runtime boundary
+
+WP01 adds a non-durable UI read/command boundary without changing any storage schema.
+
+```text
+sidepanel DOM
+└─ ui-runtime-client
+   └─ EIC_UI_COMMAND / eic.autonom.ui-command.v1
+      └─ background UI_COMMAND_HANDLERS
+         ├─ runtime/storage owner operations
+         └─ eic.autonom.ui-snapshot.v1
+            └─ detached model: config, continuity, window, audit
+```
+
+The command registry is closed. Routing metadata is separate from payload data, and each result is
+bound to the request id and command. `NANO_HEARTBEAT` returns an acknowledgement; other current
+panel commands return a complete `uiSnapshot`.
+
+The legacy top-level snapshot aliases are transitional only. The Mission domain and next durable
+schema are intentionally deferred to WP02.
+
